Graduate School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Your Path. Our Purpose. CCED helps you turn curiosity into clarity and ambition into action. Explore careers, build skills, and discover powerful opportunities. Drop-In Hours Drop-in appointments are conducted from 11:00 AM – 2:00 PM, Monday through Friday , by our Peer Career Advisors (PCA). No appointment necessary. Connect with Us \"When I applied for this internship, I'd never written a cover letter before. That was the first time I went to the career center, and they helped me write the letter during the drop-in hours. Those are fabulous.\" 29' Expected Graduate, Strategic Leadership Explore, Connect, Grow The Career Corner Podcast CCED is pleased to present the Career Corner podcast. Weekly episodes will deep dive into career topics, resources, alumni stories, and much more! New episodes launch each Thursday. Tune In Handshake Looking for a Job, Internship, or Fellowship? Last year over 140,000 opportunities were available through Handshake. Explore Handshake Career Toolkit From choosing your major to networking and landing your first role, explore the tools and guidance in our Career Toolkit. Get the Resources Featured Internships McKenna Brennan '28 By Roy H. Park School of Communications Creative Intern, American High Social Media Intern, Purple Banana Colleen Golden '27 By Roy H. Park School of Communications Public Relations Intern, Hollywood Agency Graphic Design Intern, Arocam Sports Abygail Sevegny '26 By Roy H. Park School of Communications Merchandising Intern TJX Companies Explore more We Prioritize Access & Equity The Center for Career Exploration and Development is committed to diversity, equity, and inclusion — within our office and in our community. Learn more Contact Us 101 Muller Faculty Center 953 Danby Road • Ithaca, NY 14850 Meet Our Staff careers@ithaca.edu (607) 274-3365 Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
