erviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Welcome IC Faculty & Staff! CCED assists students and alumni from all majors and class years with every aspect of career development. We value and appreciate our many collaborations with faculty and staff partners! What We Do Self-assessment, career decision-making , choosing a major Career exploration & research The internship search process The job search process Professional branding and networking The graduate/professional school search & application process Resume/CV , Cover Letter , Personal Statement assistance Interview preparation Salary negotiation Program Requests Want us to speak to your class?  CCED is able to speak on a variety of career and professional development topics including: Overview of CCED and our Services; Introduction to Career Development; Resumes; Cover Letters; Internship & Job Searching; Networking; LinkedIn & Professional Branding; Interviewing; Graduate School. Make A Request Help Us Build Learning And Career Development Opportunities CCED is always seeking out new opportunities, mentors, and partnerships as we help train the next generation of student leaders.  We value our many faculty and staff partnerships and invite you to be part of our efforts.  Please consider partnering with us to list opportunities, engage recruiters and speakers, blog, and build networks. In addition, if you would like to learn more or discuss more, please feel free to contact us at: careers@ithaca.edu Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift 