Exploring Majors Graduate School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x International Resources While no two individual experiences are the same, this page shares some resources geared towards international students and alumni as they navigate their career development. Remember that Career Center staff is always available to meet to provide more individualized support and resources, or to connect you with alumni who have relatable identities or experiences. Note:  These resources all link to external sites. We are not responsible for any third-party site content and urge discretion when utilizing these resources. As part of our ongoing DEI commitment to our IC students and alumni, we share the below career resources.  If you have any questions, concerns, or suggestions about/for this page, feel free to email them to us at careers@ithaca.edu . Business Networking International Explore BNI, a global networking platform that helps professionals grow their businesses by connecting with like-minded individuals through referrals and relationship-building. GoinGlobal Access job and internship listings, company profiles, and country-specific career resources to enhance your global job search. H-1B Employer Data Hub Access the H-1B Employer Data Hub to view key details about employers petitioning for H-1B visas for foreign workers in specialty occupations. International Labour Organization Explore global labor standards, policies, and initiatives aimed at promoting fair work conditions and improving livelihoods worldwide. Interstride Find opportunities based on your visa type and CPT/OPT eligibility, access an international network, and get tailored career and immigration support — all on the Interstride Career Portal. Jooble Browse and apply for job opportunities worldwide on Jooble, a job search engine that aggregates listings from multiple sources to help you find relevant positions. My Visa Jobs Utilize MyVisaJobs' H-1B data reports to explore detailed information on H-1B visa sponsorship, including employer filings, job trends, and visa approval rates across industries. Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
