      "title": "Veteran Resources",
      "description": "Veteran Resources | Ithaca College Skip to main content Athletics Alumni Events News Apps Connect Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. myIC Canvas Engage GIVE VISIT Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Campus Map Directions Virtual Tour APPLY Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Graduate Academics Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Our Schools Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Business Communications Health Sciences and Human Performance Humanities and Sciences Music, Theatre, and Dance Academic Calendar & Registrar Graduate and Professional Studies Career Exploration & Development Academic Support Center Course Catalog Office of the Provost Admission Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Tuition & Financial Aid Visit Student Life Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Student Affairs & Campus Life Campus Dining Residential Life Health, Wellness, and Recreation Religious & Spiritual Life Parents and Families About Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Ithaca College at a Glance Key Facts & Recognition Annual Events Sustainability at Ithaca Strategic Plan Presidential Search Office of the President Icon / Search Icon / Menu Created with Sketch. Icon / Close Created with Sketch. Search Veteran Resources Home / Center for Career Exploration and Development / Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging / Veteran Resources Center for Career Exploration and Development Connect With Us Kamai Career Quest Who We Support First Year Student Second Year Student Third Year Student Fourth Year Student Alumni Faculty and Staff Parents and Families Employers Inspiring Internships Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging: Our Commitment BIPOC Resources First-Generation Resources International Resources LGBTQIA+ Resources Neurodivergent and Disability Resources Undocumented and DACA Resources Veteran Resources Women Resources Career Toolkit Building Skills Cover Letters Creating A Four Year Plan Exploring Majors Graduate School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Veteran Resources While no two individual experiences are the same, this page shares some resources geared towards veteran students and alumni as they navigate their career development. Remember that Career Center staff is always available to meet to provide more individualized support and resources, or to connect you with alumni who have relatable identities or experiences. Note:  These resources all link to external sites. We are not responsible for any third-party site content and urge discretion when utilizing these resources. As part of our ongoing DEI commitment to our IC students and alumni, we share the below career resources.  If you have any questions, concerns, or suggestions about/for this page, feel free to email them to us at careers@ithaca.edu . American Corporate Partnership Get matched with a mentor who could help you develop and find your next career. Career OneStop – Veterans Job Matcher​ This platform helps military veterans find job opportunities that align with their skills and experience, bridging the gap between military service and civilian careers. Department of Labor: Veterans' Employment and Training Service Learn about resources, support, and programs aimed at helping veterans secure meaningful employment and success in the workforce. G.I. Jobs Search through job listings, employer resources, and career advice designed to help military veterans transition to civilian employment. Hire Heroes USA Find hands on training opportunities that will prepare you for your next career. Military Skills Translator Look for civilian jobs that match you military experience and skills. My Next Move Look at personalized career exploration and resources to find suitable job opportunities and navigate the transition to civilian employment. My Perfect Resume - Military to Civilian Resume Guide Tips and guidance on how to present military experience on your resume. USA Jobs​ Browse the official government job site where you can search for and apply to federal employment opportunities. Veterans' Employment and Training Services (VETS) This page provides resources and support to help veterans secure meaningful employment and access valuable career services. Veteran Employment Center This page connects veterans with resources, support, and opportunities to successfully transition to civilian careers. VetJobs Find jobs dedicated to helping military veterans and their families find meaningful employment. Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
    },
    "https://www.ithaca.edu/center-career-exploration-and-development/equity-inclusion-and-belonging/women-resources": {
      "title": "Women Resources",
