e School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Women Resources While no two individual experiences are the same, this page shares some resources geared towards women students and alumni as they navigate their career development. Remember that Career Center staff is always available to meet to provide more individualized support and resources, or to connect you with alumni who have relatable identities or experiences. Note:  These resources all link to external sites. We are not responsible for any third-party site content and urge discretion when utilizing these resources. As part of our ongoing DEI commitment to our IC students and alumni, we share the below career resources.  If you have any questions, concerns, or suggestions about/for this page, feel free to email them to us at careers@ithaca.edu . Advancing Women Browse through resources, events, and mentorship programs dedicated to empowering women, promoting gender equality and leadership development. Career Contessa Explore professional learning resources like articles, career courses, podcasts, advice and more all right here. Career Girls Find resources to help with college and career planning Fairygodboss Explore this online community focused on job search, career support and advice for women. InHerSight​ Search for companies and that align with your values. PowerToFly Find job opportunities, network with diverse professionals, and learn about exclusive DEIB related events here. US Department of Labor - The Women's Bureau Learn about government initiatives working to provide resources to surrport women in the workforce, advocate for fair labor practices, and promote gender equity. Where Women Work Explore career internship, apprenticeship, and job opportunities at companies that are looking for women employees. Women for Hire Explore this platform that provides job opportunities, career advice, resources, and networking events to support women's professional growth and advancement. Women’s Job List Search through jobs and employers with goals of adding more women to their workforce. Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
