es and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Building Skills Building skills and learning new things is an important part of your journey. Here are some resources to help! Choosing A Major Choosing a major is an important decision that all college students must make and the CCED is here to help! Cover Letters Your resume never travels alone. Each time you submit your resume to an employer, you should enclose a cover letter. Creating A Four Year Plan There are key things that you can do each academic year to help you get closer to the outcome you want after graduation. Graduate School CCED is available to assist Ithaca College students and alumni with graduate school decisions. Interviewing Preparing for the interview is almost as important as the interview itself. Networking Networking is communicating with people and developing contacts in order to locate possible opportunities. Resumes and CVs Your resume or CV (curriculum vitae) capture your professional story and are typically the first step of an application process. Scholarships CCED coordinates the nomination process for several scholarship opportunities. Searching For A Job Or Internship Here are some helpful quick tips to assist you with finding a job or internship. Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
