ing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x Your resume or CV ( curriculum vitae) capture your professional story and are typically the first step of an application process The Center for Career Exploration and Development (CCED) offers assistance in writing your resume or CV. For a deeper dive, check out the video at the bottom of this page. Getting Feedback Our staff is able to provide feedback on your cover letter during our drop-in hours or by appointment with a Career Engagement Specialist. Resume Writing Quick Guide & Sample Resumes Quick Guide: This Quick Guide will break down the components of a resume. Resume Writing Quick Guide Action Verb List: Need a great action verb to start that bullet point?  This amazing list has 350 of them! Action Verb List Sample Resumes: Some fields have resumes that differ significantly from the typical resume that most people know.  Here are some examples. View resume examples International Resumes/CVs: Check out our Resume vs CV Quick Guide and these two sites that offer country specific tips for resumes & CVs. SmartResume Top CV This quick 10 minute video will break down a resume and help you develop one that will tell your authentic story. Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
