    "https://www.ithaca.edu/center-career-exploration-and-development/services": {
      "title": "Services",
      "description": "Services | Ithaca College Skip to main content Athletics Alumni Events News Apps Connect Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. myIC Canvas Engage GIVE VISIT Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Campus Map Directions Virtual Tour APPLY Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Graduate Academics Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Our Schools Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Business Communications Health Sciences and Human Performance Humanities and Sciences Music, Theatre, and Dance Academic Calendar & Registrar Graduate and Professional Studies Career Exploration & Development Academic Support Center Course Catalog Office of the Provost Admission Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Tuition & Financial Aid Visit Student Life Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Student Affairs & Campus Life Campus Dining Residential Life Health, Wellness, and Recreation Religious & Spiritual Life Parents and Families About Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Ithaca College at a Glance Key Facts & Recognition Annual Events Sustainability at Ithaca Strategic Plan Presidential Search Office of the President Icon / Search Icon / Menu Created with Sketch. Icon / Close Created with Sketch. Search Services Home / Center for Career Exploration and Development / Services Center for Career Exploration and Development Connect With Us Kamai Career Quest Who We Support First Year Student Second Year Student Third Year Student Fourth Year Student Alumni Faculty and Staff Parents and Families Employers Inspiring Internships Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging: Our Commitment BIPOC Resources First-Generation Resources International Resources LGBTQIA+ Resources Neurodivergent and Disability Resources Undocumented and DACA Resources Veteran Resources Women Resources Career Toolkit Building Skills Cover Letters Creating A Four Year Plan Exploring Majors Graduate School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x The Career Center offers additional services! Career Closet CCED's career closet was created in 2018 to help address equity issues by ensuring that every student has access to professional clothing attire. Available in a variety of styles and sizes, each item is donated in good condition, dry-cleaned, and available to borrow. We offer suits, ties, dress shoes, and more! No appointment necessary, drop-in during office hours, M-F from 8:30 AM - 5:00 PM. Do you have items to donate the Career Closet?  You can drop off our gently used professional attire during our office hours. Photo Booth Make an appointment to take a professional headshot in the Photo Bomber! Need a LinkedIn picture or a new headshot for an online portfolio? Students can take a free headshot by scheduling an appointment here: https://ithaca.joinhandshake.com/stu/appointments/new . If this link does not work, log into Handshake with your Ithaca credentials, click on \"Career Center\", click on \"Appointments\", click on \"Schedule A New Appointment\" and select the appointment type you are looking for.   All other Ithaca College community members should contact the career center for availability. Interview Room The Career Center offers a private interview room! If you are looking for a private, quiet space to hold a phone or virtual interview, you can book an appointment to use the interview space. Technology or digital equipment is not provided, but there are outlets for you to bring your own devices. Book the space here: https://ithaca.joinhandshake.com/stu/appointments/new. If this link does not work, log into Handshake with your Ithaca credentials, click on \"Career Center\", click on \"Appointments\", click on \"Schedule A New Appointment\" and select the appointment type you are looking for. Appointments and Drop-Ins If you have never visited the Career Center and you're looking for a quick meeting to discuss a career-related topic, consider our Drop-In Hours (M-F from 11:00 AM - 2:00 PM). We also offer appointments with professional staff members! To learn more about Drop-Ins and Appointments, follow the link below. Meet With Us! Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
    },
