 Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x What Can I Do With This Major? The What Can I Do With This Major guide, developed by the University of Tennessee. Occupational Outlook Handbook The OOH can help you find career information on duties, education and training, pay, and outlook for hundreds of occupations. O-Net O*NET is a database that provides information about jobs and workers in the United States. Handshake Jobs, internships, fellowships, and volunteer opportunities from organizations seeking to recruit IC students and alums. CareerShift An excellent tool that helps you find companies by geographical location, find contacts at organizations, and search for jobs. Indeed Job Search Academy A free, virtual career development program brought to you by Indeed and Ithaca College to help you excel in your job search. Linked In IC Alumni Want to know what an alumnus/a is doing?  Find someone doing something interesting? Explore LinkedIn’s alumni search feature. Alumni Directory This resource will help you connect with IC Alums via e-mail. Great to use with LinkedIn Alumni. Glass Door Research employee salary, bonus, and compensation details; view actual interview questions; read detailed employee reviews; more! Big Interview Hands-on practice with mock interviews tailored to your specific major or area of interest. Transitions Abroad A site with country specific information for students interested in working or studying abroad. Peterson's Grad School Search Tool A site designed to help you find the best graduate school program for you. GradSchools.com A directory of almost 60,000 graduate programs. Connect with us facebook instagram x