      "description": "First Destination Survey | Ithaca College Skip to main content Athletics Alumni Events News Apps Connect Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. myIC Canvas Engage GIVE VISIT Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Campus Map Directions Virtual Tour APPLY Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Graduate Academics Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Our Schools Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Business Communications Health Sciences and Human Performance Humanities and Sciences Music, Theatre, and Dance Academic Calendar & Registrar Graduate and Professional Studies Career Exploration & Development Academic Support Center Course Catalog Office of the Provost Admission Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Tuition & Financial Aid Visit Student Life Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Student Affairs & Campus Life Campus Dining Residential Life Health, Wellness, and Recreation Religious & Spiritual Life Parents and Families About Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Ithaca College at a Glance Key Facts & Recognition Annual Events Sustainability at Ithaca Strategic Plan Presidential Search Office of the President Icon / Search Icon / Menu Created with Sketch. Icon / Close Created with Sketch. Search First Destination Survey Home / Center for Career Exploration and Development / First Destination Survey Center for Career Exploration and Development Connect With Us Kamai Career Quest Who We Support First Year Student Second Year Student Third Year Student Fourth Year Student Alumni Faculty and Staff Parents and Families Employers Inspiring Internships Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging Equity, Inclusion, and Belonging: Our Commitment BIPOC Resources First-Generation Resources International Resources LGBTQIA+ Resources Neurodivergent and Disability Resources Undocumented and DACA Resources Veteran Resources Women Resources Career Toolkit Building Skills Cover Letters Creating A Four Year Plan Exploring Majors Graduate School Interviewing Networking Resumes and CVs Searching For A Job Or Internship Volunteering Abroad Services Online Resources First Destination Survey Student Employment Internship Funding Resources Faculty Toolkit For Employers Gaby Quick Links Annual Report (2024-25) Learn About Career Readiness Recruiting Interest Form Program Request Form NACE 2026 Job Outlook menu Connect with us facebook instagram x First Destination Survey May 2026 Grads - Survey Opens On April 1, 2026 Every year Ithaca College participates in the First Destination Survey from the National Association for Colleges and Employers (NACE) . This survey helps to tell the story of what happens to Ithaca graduates after they complete their education at IC. As of 2024, the FDS is a requirement for graduates to receive their diplomas in the mail. How To Take The Survey Log onto your Handshake account with your Netpass - Note: Y ou must do this from a browser, the survey is not available in the Handshake app. Click on \" Career Center \" in the left menu Click the \" First Destination \" button located under the page header. Complete the survey and click the \" Submit \" button Please Note: the survey is NOT under the \"Surveys\" button, and if you click on \"Surveys\" you will not see the First Destination Survey available. You have to click directly on \"First Destination\" after clicking on \"Career Center\" Not Sure What You're Doing Yet? It's ok to complete the survey and say that and you can update it when you do. More importantly , the career center is here to help! Schedule an appointment with a Career Engagement Specialist and we'll help you navigate your next steps.  Help is available now, through graduation, and after you graduate! Connect with us facebook instagram x 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
