      "title": "Student Employment",
      "description": "Student Employment | Ithaca College Skip to main content Athletics Alumni Events News Apps Connect Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. myIC Canvas Engage GIVE VISIT Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Campus Map Directions Virtual Tour APPLY Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Graduate Academics Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Our Schools Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Business Communications Health Sciences and Human Performance Humanities and Sciences Music, Theatre, and Dance Academic Calendar & Registrar Graduate and Professional Studies Career Exploration & Development Academic Support Center Course Catalog Office of the Provost Admission Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Undergraduate Admission Graduate Admission Tuition & Financial Aid Visit Student Life Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Student Affairs & Campus Life Campus Dining Residential Life Health, Wellness, and Recreation Religious & Spiritual Life Parents and Families About Icon / Caret Created with Sketch. Ithaca College at a Glance Key Facts & Recognition Annual Events Sustainability at Ithaca Strategic Plan Presidential Search Office of the President Icon / Search Icon / Menu Created with Sketch. Icon / Close Created with Sketch. Search Student Employment Home / Center for Career Exploration and Development / Student Employment Student Employment Student Supervisors Complete Student Recruitment Process Overview Find Student Employees Form I-9 Resources for Supervisors Hiring for Specialized Roles Process for Promoting Student Employees to Student Manager Roles Student Employee Performance Review and Goal Planning Current Student Employees Student Employee Payment Information Student Employee Rights Student Employment for Summer Prospective Student Employees How to Navigate the Prospective Student Employment Job Board Federal Work Study (FWS) Job Classifications Job Series Job Levels Salary Structure Student Employment Onboarding and I9 Process International Students SSN Application Process & FNQ Ithaca College Student Employment Handbook Additional Links & Resources menu Student Employment Ithaca College Student Employment provides students the opportunity to put their academic experiences into practice in a professional setting that reflects the post-graduate workplace. Student Employment jobs offer experiential learning initiatives, and a range of transferable skills, as well as a competitive recruitment and retention process that models the professional environment. Learn more about Student Employment at IC All matriculated IC students are eligible for campus employment regardless of Federal Work Study status and can apply to open positions directly through the IC Recruitment Cloud. Apply Now New Ticketing System Use these forms to request help with student job descriptions, manage requisition-related changes, request professional development and more... Student Employment Help Desk Student Supervisors Student supervisors bring invaluable expertise and mentorship to students in the collegiate environment. Learn More Current Student Employees Already working with us? Head this way for all your student employee essentials. Get Resources Prospective Student Employees Looking for employment? Have you already applied and are not sure what your next steps are? Check- In here for next steps and some guidance. Find Employment Opportunities Peer Supervisors Do you supervise peers? Look here for professional development and support. Get Supervisor Resources 953 Danby Road, Ithaca, NY 14850 (607) 274-3011 Footer Campus Store Accessibility Guide Safety and Emergency Visit Make a Gift Campus Map Contact Directory Employment Campus Services facebook icon Created with Sketch. Facebook instagram icon Created with Sketch. Instagram youtube icon Created with Sketch. YouTube Threads icon Threads TikTock icon TikTok © 2026 Ithaca College. All rights reserved Non-Discrimination Statement | Privacy Policy"
